{"title":"2013 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 4b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_4b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all ordered pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> that satisfy the following system of equations. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/b/c3bfd209d04eef5999c64e745bbe7cca19fb2b7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{aligned} a+b&amp;=16\\\\ \\dfrac{4}{7}&amp;=\\dfrac{1}{a}+\\dfrac{1}{b}\\end{aligned}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -28px\" width=\"115\" height=\"65\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_4b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/4/aa4cce41a5e009eaf0132ab8a1877b885fc9a6b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{a} + \\frac{1}{b} = \\frac{b}{ab} + \\frac{a}{ab} = \\frac{a + b}{ab} = \\frac{16}{ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"254\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p>We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/c/4fcd0c7d2cbdc4a5c5707ffb21fb6d8c77d4125a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{7} = \\frac{16}{ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"61\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/8/14842706cf6893c31ca3aca637818e1d8b6589f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = \\frac{16}{1} \\times \\frac{7}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"101\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/b/f8b1705bf19cebbbc054d2e2dafc723900b5a9dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 4 \\times 7 = 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5b34724b26e6e168a6a505e44bc02b3d0496d00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/d/40df8769b166dae1549f6a77f53b4ee01326e155.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 16 - a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />. Plugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/e/6de37f18c7259d4c500a2b28e8ff9c74f9261a2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34e498921fe794e2df338c6a6df591c2ecbdc1a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(16 - a) = 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"118\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/2/cd212c79cbc398e46f7d422278a8671ab8a349fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16a - a^{2} = 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/3/543b3979b7d133ae5313f102c639fa510746f211.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2} - 16a + 28 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/8/4f8cbe46f5bf9867450e48dc25deeacf7ca20f54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-14$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> sum up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/09372266f72fa589bc1aba24cf2c6e85c55d946b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" /> and multiply to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/9265f5dd6dade78136a6be158ace46bf7c0f8ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35eaf1c070b55359954259c8baeb8b9ba99958b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2} - 14a - 2a + 28 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"184\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/e/98e7ec4040d1ba6a228bf3b75408d3e480ebd12a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(a - 14) - 2(a - 14) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/7/7b778f559ee0b78da24240442747016a5a4a463a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a - 2)(a - 14) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"154\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/d/a9d716fbffeba5c58cda30ab77cab7e72279481a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a - 2)(a - 14)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"121\" height=\"20\" /> to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/9/19915c772948cf20c7372499ab55cdc7520507f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a - 2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/1/4d16467a1a361297228c1eb3be6d501c124d2849.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a - 14 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />. This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf0953f43c76a5c79f339f9aee0fc2baac51413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/5/a75d29a3a31438e162d1b3050d3656c4863b4a2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Alternatively, we could have used the quadratic formula to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7ce4321ea0a4f0d367e9007357c132ba87fe1f7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{-(-16) \\pm \\sqrt{16^{2} - 4 \\times 1 \\times 28}}{2 \\times 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"266\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/0/c10e3429c16447d85ea776aba3081b7541777f0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{16 \\pm \\sqrt{256 - 112}}{2} = \\frac{16 \\pm \\sqrt{144}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"283\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/e/efe153af2fbdc174f44d6244965890922d5141bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{16 \\pm 12}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/e/fde88a9e8ca43fe13168cf23df123c7498f7caa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{16 - 12}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/c/07c7fb99388dbf90e47bcc2fb3c719bcf668f6dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{16 + 12}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/1/f3173b1ce0cbfc8abbe9da79348f2e40d540f534.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{4}{2} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"82\" height=\"38\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/5/c950c85db2b8a47e3909f7bb6307a9e6663164f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{28}{2} = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"100\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf0953f43c76a5c79f339f9aee0fc2baac51413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/4/8e4fd55286b3976702d13075c8b8f8f13569f5f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 16 - 2 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"16\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/5/a75d29a3a31438e162d1b3050d3656c4863b4a2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/2/232a6a524b4c32e14e4fa69182662c643985b170.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 16 - 14 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the ordered pairs are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/a/e7a85a6c20a8c3d99a1cc0a8abc7e967b6a79ad4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(2, 14)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"63\" height=\"32\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/5/a75264e77d35398116ae75adbc939658e39fdae3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(14, 2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"63\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017232402\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 131/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7437/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.002      1 2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_4\n100.00%    6.002      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36041:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017232402 and revision id 279723. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}